# functions/.env — LOCAL + DEPLOYED plaintext env (NOT Secret Manager).
# - Local: `firebase emulators:start` reads this file.
# - Deploy: `firebase deploy --only functions` ships it with the function (free,
#   no per-read billing). Values are visible in Cloud Console to project
#   viewers — only keys with rotatable, limited blast radius belong here.
# - NEVER commit this file (gitignored). Copy from .env.example and fill in.
# - Webhook-integrity secrets and PII stay in Secret Manager:
#   VERIFY_TOKEN, WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET, CRM_BOT_SECRET, CRM_INGEST_SECRET,
#   ADMIN_WHATSAPP_NUMBER (set via `firebase functions:secrets:set NAME`).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
PLACES_API_KEY=
WHATSAPP_TOKEN=
PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
CRM_INGEST_URL=
